  "main_theorem_verified": false,
  "scope": "Constructs exact compatible circuit partitions for admissible Eulerian four-label multigraphs with any degree at most two, including arbitrary other even degrees. Combines this with the previous exact four-regular theorem to cover maximum degree at most four and at most eight actual copies. Proves that tight local coarsening preserves every global cut inequality, an elementary compatible-triangle bundle selector, exact slack-zero/slack-two deletion witnesses, and transports the constructed partitions to original-host even-fiber and two-odd-fiber joining matching families under explicit small-boundary hypotheses. All original copies remain distinct. General four-label existence, full Proposition 4.16, Theorem 4.17 and the main theorem remain incomplete. All 69 numbered assertion records and the 49 completed count are unchanged.",
  "review": "docs/four-label-reduction-semantic-review.md",
